No.

332
00:20:04,910 --> 00:20:08,620
But it only has to happen once.

333
00:20:08,950 --> 00:20:12,000
You and I know we are perfect for each other.

334
00:20:12,290 --> 00:20:13,410
Right?

335
00:20:13,620 --> 00:20:17,290
So the only question is: Are you attracted to me?

336
00:20:19,380 --> 00:20:21,210
I don't know.

337
00:20:22,840 --> 00:20:25,760
I mean, I've never looked at you that way before.

338
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:28,140
Well start looking.

339
00:20:38,610 --> 00:20:39,650
Wow.

340
00:20:39,860 --> 00:20:41,070
Exactly!

341
00:20:41,280 --> 00:20:43,190
And you just know I'm gonna be the guy...

342
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:46,360
...caught behind this hammerhead in traffic!

343
00:20:48,990 --> 00:20:50,200
Right.

344
00:20:50,410 --> 00:20:52,080
You're right.

345
00:20:52,450 --> 00:20:53,540
you know What?

346
00:20:53,910 --> 00:20:57,040
I forgot, I'm supposed to pick up a friend at the airport.

347
00:20:57,250 --> 00:20:59,380
I am so sorry. I'm so...

348
00:20:59,590 --> 00:21:02,960
If you want to stay and finish your drinks, please do.

349
00:21:03,170 --> 00:21:05,590
I'm sorry, I gotta go. I'm sorry.

350
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:07,510
But...

351
00:21:16,980 --> 00:21:18,940
Excuse me! Pardon me! Excuse me.

352
00:21:19,150 --> 00:21:20,770
I'm sorry. Ha, ha.

353
00:21:20,980 --> 00:21:23,820
Toby, for God's sake, will you let it go?

354
00:21:24,030 --> 00:21:25,780
There's no Rachel!

355
00:21:30,620 --> 00:21:33,790
Oh, Hey. I got that.

356
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:36,500
Thanks, sweetie.

357
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:36,500
no problem.

358
00:21:42,340 --> 00:21:44,760
I cannot wait for you to meet my friends.

359
00:21:44,970 --> 00:21:47,510
Really? You don't think they'll judge and ridicule me?

360
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:49,510
No, they will. I just, uh...

361
00:21:49,720 --> 00:21:51,010
Can't wait. Heh.

362
00:21:51,220 --> 00:21:52,760
Come on, they're gonna love you.

